{"3623470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Ignition", "steam_appid": 3623470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Note - </strong>Project Ignition is still in early stages of development. Our art assets are under development and we plan on improving and polishing many elements of the experience. Please join our Discord for updates.<strong>]</strong><br><br>Set in a solar system once dominated by a bio-mechanical species known as the Fossils, you and your team drive to salvage a powerful energy source - Amber and the technology they used to wield it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXOFRAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/779eb71a6074ba299444faa921ebd25a.poster.avif?t=1785981762\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/779eb71a6074ba299444faa921ebd25a.webm?t=1785981762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Exoframes - specialized battle vehicles with unique abilities. Engage in fast-paced duels, using a variety of weaponry and gadgets, ranging from close range melee to long range artillery. Style on your opponents and drift circles around them. Skilled driving and positioning are key to winning fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HAULER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/c7a010a5955254a6e61d08cee7ef557b.poster.avif?t=1785981762\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/c7a010a5955254a6e61d08cee7ef557b.webm?t=1785981762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escort your harvester bots as they extract Amber and use it to power the Hauler - your moving base. Collect upgrades and race your Hauler to the centre before your opponents do to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/dbb8676efe57507948d3bb206619d09d.poster.avif?t=1785981762\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/dbb8676efe57507948d3bb206619d09d.webm?t=1785981762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vehicle with control over color, surface finish and decals. [Wheels and spoiler customization in the works]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Planned Content for Beta Testing:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 6 Exoframes with completed models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level design improvements and custom level art assets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvements to game loop and general UX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle tuning based on playtesting feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed settings and experience customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If the experience of a skill-based vehicle battler interests you, stick with us as we do our best to build something unique.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Note - </strong>Project Ignition is still in early stages of development. Our art assets are under development and we plan on improving and polishing many elements of the experience. Please join our Discord for updates.<strong>]</strong><br><br>Set in a solar system once dominated by a bio-mechanical species known as the Fossils, you and your team drive to salvage a powerful energy source - Amber and the technology they used to wield it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXOFRAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/779eb71a6074ba299444faa921ebd25a.poster.avif?t=1785981762\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/779eb71a6074ba299444faa921ebd25a.webm?t=1785981762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Exoframes - specialized battle vehicles with unique abilities. Engage in fast-paced duels, using a variety of weaponry and gadgets, ranging from close range melee to long range artillery. Style on your opponents and drift circles around them. Skilled driving and positioning are key to winning fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HAULER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/extras/c7a010a5955254a6e61d08cee7ef557b.poster.avif?t=1785981762\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam