"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Project Ignition is an objective-oriented, third-person, PvP vehicle battler where combat is centered around the way you drive. Pilot the Exoframes - a set of weaponized vehicles, with unique combat styles and abilities.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/0848776812f3e5e158e30b51ab662ec8ced7e153/header.jpg?t=1785981762", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/c959b507c67561d403b39a3760d2fcb2b2ba0be6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785981762", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623470/c959b507c67561d403b39a3760d2fcb2b2ba0be6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785981762", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 8th Gen / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050Ti / AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> No Dedicated Sound Card needed<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No VR Support</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBD MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> We are still testing on a